(7310392, 1141051, 51379, '<td valign="top">Wow! Hoping to see this with a ribbon,I can even see the blood drops from the fish stopped in mid air. the gulls eye is nice and sharp, good detail on the bird,very well done.</td>', 'Wow! Hoping to see this with a ribbon,I can even see the blood drops from the fish stopped in mid air. the gulls eye is nice and sharp, good detail on the bird,very well done.', '2015-02-04 00:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310496, 1140843, 93565, '<td valign="top">The stopped motion of the rider''s face is great. I''d like to see a bit more, more detail in the rest of the scene, considering the prompt.</td>', 'The stopped motion of the rider''s face is great. I''d like to see a bit more, more detail in the rest of the scene, considering the prompt.', '2015-02-04 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310497, 1141009, 93565, '<td valign="top">Excellent stopped motion. Not sure about centered comp, but very good capture in every sense otherwise. Wonderful soft light, wonderful depth.</td>', 'Excellent stopped motion. Not sure about centered comp, but very good capture in every sense otherwise. Wonderful soft light, wonderful depth.', '2015-02-04 05:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310499, 1140726, 93565, '<td valign="top">I appreciate you subject mater but the true subject would''ve been better served by a macro treatment, to truly show the grains of snow. As is, the stopped motion is but a minor character, undiscernable.</td>', 'I appreciate you subject mater but the true subject would''ve been better served by a macro treatment, to truly show the grains of snow. As is, the stopped motion is but a minor character, undiscernable.', '2015-02-04 05:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310502, 1140733, 93565, '<td valign="top">Still significant blur and lack of clarity. A faster shutter was needed here.</td>', 'Still significant blur and lack of clarity. A faster shutter was needed here.', '2015-02-04 05:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310504, 1141057, 93565, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but due to the nature of the shot, a general lack of composition is noteworthy.</td>', 'Good idea, but due to the nature of the shot, a general lack of composition is noteworthy.', '2015-02-04 05:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310508, 1140696, 93565, '<td valign="top">I very much appreciate the departure from making the most prominent bit your subject. Downplaying the actual stopped motion is interesting, nice. I''m torn, requesting the bird have wings spread or folded. Spread, we are drawn to a better example of stopped motion, closed, and we have a greater downplay of the idea and thus a greater appreciation for it existing within (but not completely interrupting) a scene that departs from the prompt. A hard question.</td>', 'I very much appreciate the departure from making the most prominent bit your subject. Downplaying the actual stopped motion is interesting, nice. I''m torn, requesting the bird have wings spread or folded. Spread, we are drawn to a better example of stopped motion, closed, and we have a greater downplay of the idea and thus a greater appreciation for it existing within (but not completely interrupting) a scene that departs from the prompt. A hard question.', '2015-02-04 05:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310509, 1141051, 93565, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture somewhat muddled by the clarity of the sea. Still, very good.</td>', 'An excellent capture somewhat muddled by the clarity of the sea. Still, very good.', '2015-02-04 05:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310511, 1140986, 93565, '<td valign="top">More focus on the composition would aid the direction of the photo, particularly concerning the odd crop ratio.</td>', 'More focus on the composition would aid the direction of the photo, particularly concerning the odd crop ratio.', '2015-02-04 05:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310513, 1140790, 93565, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous and wonderful photo, one I would count among my favorites, but hardly suiting the prompt.</td>', 'A gorgeous and wonderful photo, one I would count among my favorites, but hardly suiting the prompt.', '2015-02-04 05:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310515, 1141030, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting usage of the sea to be something else entirely. Looks nearly like some alien plant.</td>', 'Interesting usage of the sea to be something else entirely. Looks nearly like some alien plant.', '2015-02-04 05:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310517, 1141058, 93565, '<td valign="top">An expansion of DoF would hugely benefit this. The lack of clarity is disappointing and the only drawback to this shot.</td>', 'An expansion of DoF would hugely benefit this. The lack of clarity is disappointing and the only drawback to this shot.', '2015-02-04 05:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310520, 1140998, 93565, '<td valign="top">Good job thinking outside the box, but a generally uninteresting subject matter, all things considered.</td>', 'Good job thinking outside the box, but a generally uninteresting subject matter, all things considered.', '2015-02-04 05:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310525, 1141040, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is an odd shot. It''s going to inherently get downvoted due to it being your pet, and due to the poor lighting. I''m curious, however, how the shot was captured, with the mouse in frame etc. Hopefully comments will be posted. In any case, interesting composition considering the  situation.</td>', 'This is an odd shot. It''s going to inherently get downvoted due to it being your pet, and due to the poor lighting. I''m curious, however, how the shot was captured, with the mouse in frame etc. Hopefully comments will be posted. In any case, interesting composition considering the  situation.', '2015-02-04 05:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310526, 1140446, 93565, '<td valign="top">Sadly, while these animals were likely moving, this shot makes them both look entirely static. A stopped motion frame generally depicts rapid action, frozen with a fast shutter, to show action, but this lacks this, and is simply two giraffes touching.</td>', 'Sadly, while these animals were likely moving, this shot makes them both look entirely static. A stopped motion frame generally depicts rapid action, frozen with a fast shutter, to show action, but this lacks this, and is simply two giraffes touching.', '2015-02-04 05:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
