(7315026, 1141062, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you didn''t try to catch a skier doing some fancy tricks in the air, now that would of been quite amazing, this seems just a little to boring and flat. I love all the ski marks though.<br/> <br/>Already voted.</td>', 'Not sure why you didn''t try to catch a skier doing some fancy tricks in the air, now that would of been quite amazing, this seems just a little to boring and flat. I love all the ski marks though. Already voted.', '2015-02-08 19:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
