(7315515, 1140733, 83149, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=93565" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">spiritualspatula</a>, this really needed a higher shutter speed.  Probably 1/800 as a minimum.  I think you had a good idea, and if you had actually gotten a nice crisp image this would have done very well.</td>', 'I have to agree with  spiritualspatula, this really needed a higher shutter speed.  Probably 1/800 as a minimum.  I think you had a good idea, and if you had actually gotten a nice crisp image this would have done very well.', '2015-02-09 11:43:23.000000', NULL, 0),
